Native formats
---------------

All integers are unsigned little-endian; all fields are checked. The body
has no trailing bytes. Every carrier is paired with a whole-hash proof that
binds Source, Original scope, operands, family key, Root import and inputs.

* Seed: L026TS01, degree:u16, size:u16, then size point:u16. At most7,030B.
* Pair: L026PF01, degree:u16, member_size:u16, member_count:u8, then one or
  two sorted distinct point arrays. At most14,049B. Equal member sizes and
  canonical ordering are checked; a singleton has only one stored member.
* Tags: L026TG01, count:u16, then (ordinal:u16,vertex:u16,tag:u8), in strict
  ordinal order, with unique vertices. Tag0 fixes,1 swaps,2 is outside this
  particular stabilizer. A sixteen-map output has90B, not a full map cache;
  a complete3,510-entry union has17,560B. Missing entries have no tag.
* Rows: L026RW01,count:u16, followed by45-byte records: free_index:u32,
  owner:u32, hit:u8, parity:u8, three factor tags:u8, full witness SHA256:32B.
  Miss parity is255, hit parity is0 or1. Maximum46,090B. This is a numerical
  certificate carrier, not the existing typed publication ledger format.

